    "text": "Accelerator Program\nAre You Worth Following?\nPage 2\nAre You Worth Following?\nThe Truth Bomb\nThese chapters are not for fragile egos. Approach with caution, because your sense of self may\nbe challenged. That is the point. This process is designed to force growth, clarity, and sharper\nartistic development.\nThere are millions of independent artists. Every day, new songs hit streaming platforms, social\nmedia feeds, and short-form video apps, each fighting for attention, recognition, and fans. The\nmarket is crowded, and talent alone is not always enough.\nThink back to high school. Everyone wanted to be close to the cool person. Maybe it was their\nlook, humor, confidence, communication style, daring choices, or ability to make the room pay\nattention. That \"cool\" appeal made people want to be in their circle.\nHollywood and the music industry work in a similar way, just with a lot more money involved.\nThis is not about becoming a bully or creating a fake persona. It is about understanding\nlikability, uniqueness, magnetism, and the reasons someone would want to follow you.\nCore Question\nIf a stranger sees you, hears your music, watches your content, or lands on your profile, do they\nfeel a reason to follow, remember, or care?"
