    "text": "Accelerator Program\nAre You Worth Following?\nPage 4\nAre You Worth Following?\nBrand Image Is Perception\nYour look and brand image must be different, new, and unique while still being relatable to an\naudience. Otherwise, you are simply another person making music, and many people are trying.\nBrand image sits between what you do and how people feel about what you do. It includes\nnatural features, expressions, posture, creative choices, colors, styling, fashion, symbols, and\nthe repeated visual decisions that help people understand you.\nArt and beauty are subjective, but public perception is shaped by the broader audience, not\nonly one supportive friend. Your brand image lives in that collective reaction.\nBrand Image Formula\nYour strategy and actions create signals. Those signals shape your image. Your image affects\nhow people feel about you. That feeling determines whether they remember, follow, share, or\nignore."
