    "text": "Accelerator Program\nAre You Worth Following?\nPage 5\nAre You Worth Following?\nBowie, Ziggy Stardust & Visual Storytelling\nConsider David Bowie. A portrait can show a talented artist, but a fully built persona can create\nmythology. Without context, a viewer may see only a well-shot portrait of a young British artist.\nWith visual storytelling, that same person becomes part of a cultural universe.\nA portrait can be beautiful and still require context.\nA persona can turn context into mythology.\nZiggy Stardust was not just an outfit. It was a visual world, a story, a sound, an attitude, and a\nway for people to understand Bowie as something larger than a regular performer. That is the\npower of storytelling through brand image.\nThe Lesson\nYour potential fans may be unaware and indifferent at first. Your job is to give them enough\nidentity, story, and presentation to understand why they should care."
