    "text": "Remember, this is just the semantic level in the songwriting and top line.\nWe still need to analyze rhyme, rhythms, and production/composition, but we'll save that\nfor another season of Hit Songwriting 101. One thing is certain: if you've made it this far,\nyou won’t write songs the same way again."
